Final gates for the Linux release branch 73-linux-release (#73), 2026-10-22
Commit: 1d722101c10656f7ed5753cdceb9c9d73b874c82 (origin/73-linux-release when the run started). Fresh clone from GitHub
  on sigil-fpga-build, detached at that SHA, `git status --porcelain` empty before and after; a second worktree of
  the same clone at the same SHA ran the Linux boot. deps/ and third_party/ linked from the rel73 gate setup
  (~/rel73/sigil), as in the two earlier gates.
The commit contains the walker-race fix #74 (73-oops-fix 31a1568 RTL + 2968b6d evidence, merged in f6d213b), the F2
  Debian results (73-linux-debian 6881bff, merged in 2b96c14) and the docs / helper-script commits up to 1d72210.
Host: sigil-fpga-build (AWS r7iz.8xlarge, 32 vCPU, Ubuntu 24.04.1), at most 8 parallel jobs: chain A VJOBS=6,
  chain B VJOBS=2 for its build, then one simulation process. Other workflows' simulations ran on the host at the
  same time (load 5 to 12). The Verilator 5.044 lint ran on macOS.

